      "mergeID": "5be233807bbeb21f3c5ac20c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I'd like to optimize my Avatars even more by adding LOD groups so that once an avatar is a certain distances away it'll Render a Lower Poly version of the avatar. If I add this currently the SDK says it can't upload as it doesn't allow LOD Group on avatars. Any way we can enable this? Or perhaps have VRChat force a default/blank 0 poly 0 material Mesh or disable the mesh renderers on an avatar at a certain  distance? I believe this would greatly improve performance. It could be a Safety/Comfort setting that's toggable or a world setting for worlds that need large view distance.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Avatar LOD groups / Render Distance",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "59fd67f03637496eb29f8141",
